# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════
# AppleLink — Environment Variables Example
# Copy this file to .env and fill in your values
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════

# Supabase Configuration
# Get these from: https://supabase.com/dashboard → Project Settings → API
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-id.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...

# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Phone OTP Setup (Twilio via Supabase Dashboard)
# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
# No env vars needed here — Twilio is configured directly in Supabase:
#
# 1. Go to Supabase Dashboard → Authentication → Providers → Phone
# 2. Enable the Phone provider
# 3. Select "Twilio" as the SMS provider
# 4. Enter your Twilio credentials:
#    - Account SID (from https://console.twilio.com)
#    - Auth Token (from https://console.twilio.com)
#    - Messaging Service SID (create one at https://console.twilio.com/sms/services)
# 5. Save
#
# That's it! Supabase handles the OTP sending/verification internally.
